# Training Asset Standards

When creating or editing training materials in this repo:

1. **Language:** 繁體中文書面語（面向學員的說明、講義、講者腳本）；正式會議紀錄／表格亦用書面語
2. **Demos:** Prefer error-free, copy-paste-ready templates (VBA, prompts, sample transcripts)
3. **Minutes format:** Use columns 議項 / 內容摘要 / 跟進人員·部門 / 限期 when showing school-format output
4. **Metaphors over jargon:** Explain `@Folder` as giving the AI intern the right filing cabinet — not vector databases
5. **Assets live in:** `trainer/` (講者), `handouts/` (學員), `activity-*/` (課堂實操)

Reference deliverables: `trainer/on-stage-checklist.md`, `trainer/rag-at-folder-metaphor.md`, `trainer/demo-vba-pptx/`, `trainer/demo-chaotic-transcript/`
